IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P4-gate`

-- P4-annex-xiv: Annex XIV, "The list of codes, categories and corresponding types of AI systems for the purpose of the notification procedure referred to in Article 30" (consolidated lines 1958 to 2010).
-- Annex XIV was inserted by the Omnibus (marker `▼M1 INSERTED`): it has only the text as amended, and the text as enacted has no Annex XIV.
-- Annex XIV is given effect by Article 30(2) (the electronic notification tool and the list of codes), so it is in the group of Articles 28 to 39 (assumed, not ruled: PLAN.md section 3).
-- A date asked before 27 July 2026 answers NOTHING (the Annex is not in the text as enacted); before 2 August 2025 the group does not apply and the answer is NOTHING too.

§ `Annex XIV: the parties and acts of the regulative rule`

DECLARE `Annex XIV party` IS ONE OF
    `Annex XIV conformity assessment body`

DECLARE `Annex XIV act` IS ONE OF
    `Annex XIV 4 use the lists of codes, categories and corresponding types of AI systems when specifying the types of AI systems in the application for designation`

§ `Annex XIV points 2 and 3: the table of codes`

-- One row for each code of the Annex, in its order. `point` and `letter` are the Annex's own numbering (point 2 letters a and b, point 3 letters a to d);
-- `category` is the heading the Annex gives the group of codes; `type` is the Annex's own words for the type of AI systems.
DECLARE `Annex XIV entry` HAS
    point     IS A NUMBER
    letter    IS A STRING
    category  IS A STRING
    code      IS A STRING
    type      IS A STRING

