@ref Annex XIV points 2 and 3 (src:1964-2007)
GIVEN `the code` IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` MEANS
    IF any (GIVEN e YIELD e's code EQUALS `the code`) `Annex XIV as amended the entries`
    THEN TRUE
    ELSE FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text hands the question to the list): "The list of codes, categories and corresponding types of AI systems" set out in the Annex

GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the code` IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` MEANS
    `Art 28 to 39 the maybe-answer when the group applies` `the date asked`
        (CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
         WHEN `as enacted` THEN NOTHING  -- VERSION as enacted. NOTHING-kind (silent): Annex XIV was inserted by the Omnibus and is not in the text as enacted
         WHEN `as amended` THEN JUST (`Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` `the code`))  -- VERSION as amended

